OL,3,GNEWSAMcCartney praises musician's songs
OL,4,Aafter intimate gig
OL,5,
OL,6,FA singer-songwriter has described the
OL,7,Fmoment Sir Paul McCartney told her she
OL,8,Fhad "great songs" after she performed
OL,9,Fin front the former Beatle.
OL,11,FEmily Rhodes, from Kirkham, recently
OL,12,Fcompleted a songwriting and performance
OL,13,Fdegree at Liverpool Institute for
OL,14,FPerforming Arts (LIPA), where she was
OL,15,Fselected for a one-to-one songwriting
OL,16,Fsession with the former Beatle.
OL,18,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Lancashire, she
OL,19,Fsaid: "He seemed to really enjoy it and
OL,20,Fsaid I had great songs and a great
OL,21,Fvoice."
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
